      en: ["Significant producer of wolframite (tungsten ore).", "Tungsten has an extremely high melting point.", "Used in metallurgy and electronics.", "Small-scale mining operated by local cooperatives.", "Subject to the ITSCI traceability system.", "Tungsten exports are an important source of foreign currency.", "Contributes to job creation in rural areas."]
