      en: ["Largest brewery and beverage producer in Rwanda.", "Part of the international Heineken Group.", "Produces popular local beers like Primus and Mützig.", "Official bottler for Coca-Cola in Rwanda.", "One of the largest industrial employers and taxpayers.", "Extensive distribution network throughout the country.", "Invests in water treatment and local raw material sourcing."]
