      en: ["Largest and oldest textile factory in Rwanda.", "Produces fabrics for the local market and uniforms.", "Faces competition from imported second-hand clothing.", "Part of the 'Made in Rwanda' initiative to promote local production.", "Efforts to modernize the facilities.", "Potential to create jobs in the manufacturing sector.", "Processes cotton into various types of fabrics."]
