      en: ["Leading local manufacturer of intravenous fluids.", "Reduces reliance on imported pharmaceuticals.", "Key supplier to the Rwandan healthcare system.", "Manufacturing facility built to international standards.", "Strict quality control to ensure safety.", "Part of the strategy to strengthen the local pharma industry.", "Creates skilled jobs in the healthcare sector."]
